Chapter: ProseMismatch
  cites Foreword chapter Console

 A Wallet is a record containing:
 - coins : Integer

 A Colour is one of:
 - Red
 - Blue

Section: Types

  Purse = record {
    coins : Integer
  }

 To fill-purse (amount) (extra) gives a Purse:

Section: Functions

  fill-purse : Integer -> Purse
  fill-purse (n) = Purse { coins = n }

 We say:
 the purse keeps it safe.

  purse-coins : Purse -> Integer
  purse-coins (p) = p.coins

Section: Body

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni (show (purse-coins (fill-purse 7)))
  end
